Scope of derivation
-------------------

The upstream source was read and used as the reference for this port. The framework
layer was rewritten for libxposed API 102 (the upstream uses the legacy Xposed API via
YukiHookAPI), so the hook implementation itself is new code, but the following were
deliberately kept identical to upstream so that behaviour and existing configuration
stay compatible:

  - the three interception points:
      AccessibilityManagerService#addClient
      AccessibilityManagerService#getEnabledAccessibilityServiceList
      ContentProvider$Transport#call (authority "settings", method "GET_secure")
  - the replacement values those hooks return (0L / empty list / "" / "0")
  - the Settings.Secure generation-index invalidation
    (Bundle key "_generation_index" set to -1)
  - the configuration group name ("config") and the hidden-list key ("_block_apps")
  - the local fallback preferences file naming convention ("<package>_preferences")

